On the locomole benchmark, it reaches state-of-the-art results from multi-session reasoning tasks.

00:05:24.860 --> 00:05:29.360
Teams building personalized agents should evaluate the fact extraction step

00:05:29.360 --> 00:05:35.600
against Corsair memory representations. Cache weaver maintains a prefix tree of recently served

