00:07:30.860 --> 00:07:37.580
time orthogonalization so multiple non orthogonal directions can be injected into the residual

00:07:37.580 --> 00:07:47.080
stream without collapse. On GSM 8K, it preserves 98% accuracy while adding three concurrent non-mathematical

00:07:47.080 --> 00:07:55.520
